Package: chdp
Type: Package
Title: Covariate-dependent hierarchical Dirichlet process for cluster analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Author: person("Huizi", "Zhang", email = "H.Zhang-144@sms.ed.ac.uk",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Huizi Zhang <H.Zhang-144@sms.ed.ac.uk>
Description: This package implements the MCMC algorithm for 
    covariate-dependent hierarchical Dirichlet process (C-HDP) to cluster 
    observations across related groups. The nonparametric C-HDP prior is applied 
    to incorporate externel covariates through two types of kernel functions,
    namely a Gaussian kernel and a periodic kernel, and is demonstrated by 
    applications to a single-cell RNA-sequencing dataset and a calcium imaging 
    dataset.
